# Deployment Guide

## Platform
PythonAnywhere

## Deployment Steps

1. Upload project files.
2. Configure the Flask application.
3. Install the required dependencies.
4. Configure the WSGI file.
5. Reload the application.

## Available Endpoints

- GET /health
- POST /predict
- GET /history

